<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets 300 mln Swiss franc bond. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets 300 mln Swiss franc bond. [CORRECTED 11:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CS First Boston and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50 PCT  MATURITY    19.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.60    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   24.JAN.97</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>(Corrects guarantor from Deutsche Morgan Grenfell to Deutsche Bank)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
